{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29031","headline":"朱坡故少保杜公池亭 · 许浑","name":"朱坡故少保杜公池亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杜陵池榭绮城东，孤岛回汀路不穷。\n高岫乍疑三峡近，远波初似五湖通。\n楸梧叶暗潇潇雨，菱荇花香淡淡风。\n还有昔时巢燕在，飞来飞去画堂中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29031.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29031","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}